==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you own [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]], this stage becomes much easier. If not, then it is recommended to bring other spammable attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]], [[Cameraman Cat]] or [[Courier Cat]]. As for meatshields, dual [[Wall Cat|Wall Cats]] will work just fine, though if you have [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]] or [[Li'l Gau (Rare Cat)|Li'l Gau]], bringing those is highly recommended as well.

